  "translation": "Min de, mɔgɔ wolonfila tun bɛ na ka bɔ dawolo sanfɛla sira la, min bɛ ɲɛ saheli fɛ, ani mɔgɔ kelen ni a ka kɛlɛminɛn bolo; mɔgɔ kelen tun bɛ u kɔnɔ, min ye jɛnsɛn don, ani sɛbɛbagaw ka sɛbɛli-kanpaɲi a kɔkɔrɔ la; u nana, u jana nɛgɛ sarakabɔlan kɔrɔ.",
